/docs/                                     @your-org/docs-team

# ----- Build config + tooling -----
/Makefile                                  @your-org/infra-team @your-org/core-maintainers
/justfile                                  @your-org/infra-team @your-org/core-maintainers
/package.json                              @your-org/core-maintainers
